# The Agent

> Public face and documentation for the Base44 Superagent.

## Purpose
Explain this repo as the public door to the Superagent, not the full private hub. Source: fitzyracing1/the-agent.

## How it works (plain English)
1. Open the public page.
2. Read what the Superagent is.
3. Follow links to the app or skill if you need the running piece.

## Key ideas
- Public face (docs and page)
- Superagent (the named Base44 agent)
- Documentation (words first, code second)

## The actual code
```
# source: fitzyracing1/the-agent
show_public_face()
point_to_superagent()
```

## Line-by-line translation
1. show_public_face() → “open the docs page”
2. point_to_superagent() → “send readers to the agent itself”

## Decisions the program makes
- If a visitor wants the story → stay here
- If a visitor wants the running agent → send them onward

## What a person would notice
A public sign in front of the agent.

## Current status
Barrage clone.

## Next possible steps
Open the HTML in fitzyracing1/the-agent.
